      "one_paragraph": "The Xilvaneth (Elf) are a expansionist theocratic people seeded in jungle, dense forest. They prize freedom, cunning, strength, lean toward the military sphere, and field archers, light_infantry, light_cavalry. Outsiders are met as xenophobic; their patrons touch night, death, war."
